# Portfolio P&L Attribution

Use this rule when the task asks to explain realized portfolio performance, security or sector contributions, fees, benchmark-relative return, or daily P&L reconciliation.

1. Read `SKILL.md` and `references/input_contract.md` before calculating.
2. Use `scripts/attribute_portfolio.py`; do not reimplement the accounting logic in prose or ad hoc code.
3. Reject duplicate `(date, symbol)` keys and missing same-date returns. Never forward-fill returns across dates.
4. Report the generated `security_attribution.csv`, `sector_attribution.csv`, `daily_attribution.csv`, and `summary.json` files, including warnings and reconciliation errors.
5. Treat results as research accounting only. Do not provide investment recommendations or silently repair source data.
